        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Ten years of congressional service constitutes significant experience.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Being re-elected implies political success and public approval.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the addressee is capable of providing authoritative insight based on tenure.",
        "confidence": 0.87
