    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 45210,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45210.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "You're listening to Closer Look. I'm Ed Lanane. We're here in Washington talking with Congressman Tom McClintock from California's 4th District. All right, let's take a closer look at the 4th. Anybody listening here would know we're talking about gold country, right? It touches multiple counties from Lake Tahoe down through Yosemite, Kings Canyon. Because of your stature in Congress, Congressman, you're often asked to speak on issues and events that are of a national nature. But what would people of the 4th tell you are some things that are really important still to them back home?",
